  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact EU-Health directive Pharmaceuticals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will result in an assessment that provides information on how adapting to Directive 2001/82/EC will affect the Ukrainian private sector, the pharmaceutical sector. By answering the following three guiding questions for the Ministry of Health:1.	What will the impact be on Ukraine&#x2019;s pharmaceutical sector of harmonizing with this European Union (EU) directive?2.	How have other Eastern European countries, that have recently become an EU member state, handled the harmonisation of their own pharmaceutical sector with the EU internal market?3.	What recommendations could there be for Ukraine, when aligning Ukraine&#x2019;s regulations to the EU?</narrative>
  </description>
